      "description": "Delhi NCR Metro is a Material 3 companion for the Delhi Metro and Noida Metro\nnetworks.\n\nSwitch operators, plan trips with least-distance or minimum-interchange\nstrategies, and follow cross-network journeys that transfer at Sector 52/51\nwith clear dual-ticket fares. Browse lines and stations, check first and last\ntrains, follow service alerts, and open the network map with zoom and save.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Delhi Metro (DMRC) and Noida Metro (NMRC) catalogs\n* Network switcher with local persistence\n* Cross-network journey planning at Sector 52/51\n* Journey strategies, fares, and transfer walk legs\n* Station search with local cache\n* Line explorer and station detail\n* Network map view with save\n* Notifications / service alerts\n* Light, dark, and Material You theming\n\nReleases are built with Expo EAS, published on GitHub Releases, and\nmirrored into this F-Droid-compatible repository.\n\nPackage ID: codes.tashif.delhimetro\n",
